      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Toyota Tsusho built Kenya’s first full‑scale fertilizer blending plant at Ngeria, just outside Eldoret, boosting regional agriculture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eldoret",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Athletes worldwide flock to Eldoret’s high‑altitude training centers, where the IAAF’s facility and local camps help shape Olympic champions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
